OL,3,GNEWSAGiant Moon artwork to light up
OL,4,Achurch
OL,5,
OL,6,FA huge illuminated Moon artwork that
OL,7,Fhas been displayed around the world is
OL,8,Fset to arrive in Jersey later this
OL,9,Fyear.
OL,11,FArtHouse Jersey has announced it will
OL,12,Fbring artist Luke Jerram's Museum of
OL,13,Fthe Moon to St Helier Methodist Centre
OL,14,Ffrom 15 to 29 November as part of the
OL,15,FButterfield Public Art Series.
OL,17,FThe 20ft (6m) installation, which
OL,18,Ffeatures detailed Nasa imagery of the
OL,19,Flunar surface alongside a specially
OL,20,Fcreated soundscape, will hang inside
OL,21,Fthe church and be free for the public
OL,22,Fto visit.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
