OL,3,GNEWSAGiant Moon artwork to light up
OL,4,Achurch
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe artwork has toured internationally,
OL,7,Fappearing at venues including London's
OL,8,FNatural History Museum, Glastonbury
OL,9,FFestival and the Commonwealth Games in
OL,10,FAustralia.
